UnitVoterPaymentsModule::constructor
├── when the VE address is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the FeeManager admin is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
└── when every check passes
    ├── it should set VE to the provided address
    ├── it should make FEE_MANAGER administered by FEE_MANAGER_ADMIN_ROLE
    ├── it should make FEE_MANAGER_ADMIN_ROLE self administered
    └── it should grant FEE_MANAGER_ADMIN_ROLE to the fee manager admin

UnitVoterPaymentsModule::adminRoleSelfRotation
└── when an admin grants the admin role to a new holder
    └── it should let the new holder grant the operational role

UnitVoterPaymentsModule::supportsInterface
├── when the queried interface is IVoterPaymentsModule
│   └── it should return true
├── when the queried interface is IERC165
│   └── it should return true
├── when the queried interface is IAccessControl
│   └── it should return true
└── when the queried interface is random
    └── it should return false

UnitVoterPaymentsModule::revokeRole
├── when revoking the last holder of the fee manager admin role
│   └── it should revert with LastRoleHolder
└── when revoking a non last holder of the fee manager admin role
    └── it should remove the role from the holder

UnitVoterPaymentsModule::renounceRole
├── when renouncing the last holder of the fee manager admin role
│   └── it should revert with LastRoleHolder
└── when renouncing a non last holder of the fee manager admin role
    └── it should remove the role from the caller
